 "content": "\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h1>⟦h¦¦Import⟧</h1>\n<p>⟦r¦¦If you have posts or comments in another system, WordPress can import those into this site. To get started, choose a system to import from below:⟧</p>\n\n<table class=\"widefat importers striped\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\t<tr class='importer-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='import-system'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-title'>⟦r¦¦Blogger⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-action'><a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/update.php?action=install-plugin&#038;plugin=blogger-importer&#038;from=import&#038;_wpnonce={{nonce:install-plugin_blogger-importer}}\" class=\"install-now\" data-slug=\"blogger-importer\" data-name=\"⟦a¦¦Blogger⟧\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦plugin¦Install ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦Blogger⟧⟫ now⟧\">⟦r¦plugin¦Install Now⟧</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=blogger-importer&#038;from=import&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦¦More information about ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦Blogger⟧⟫⟧\">⟦r¦¦Details⟧</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-desc'>⟦r¦¦Import posts, comments, and users from a Blogger blog.⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr class='importer-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='import-system'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-title'>⟦r¦¦Categories and Tags Converter⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-action'><a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/update.php?action=install-plugin&#038;plugin=wpcat2tag-importer&#038;from=import&#038;_wpnonce={{nonce:install-plugin_wpcat2tag-importer}}\" class=\"install-now\" data-slug=\"wpcat2tag-importer\" data-name=\"⟦a¦¦Categories and Tags Converter⟧\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦plugin¦Install ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦Categories and Tags Converter⟧⟫ now⟧\">⟦r¦plugin¦Install Now⟧</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=wpcat2tag-importer&#038;from=import&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦¦More information about ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦Categories and Tags Converter⟧⟫⟧\">⟦r¦¦Details⟧</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-desc'>⟦r¦¦Convert existing categories to tags or tags to categories, selectively.⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr class='importer-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='import-system'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-title'>⟦r¦¦LiveJournal⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-action'><a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/update.php?action=install-plugin&#038;plugin=livejournal-importer&#038;from=import&#038;_wpnonce={{nonce:install-plugin_livejournal-importer}}\" class=\"install-now\" data-slug=\"livejournal-importer\" data-name=\"⟦a¦¦LiveJournal⟧\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦plugin¦Install ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦LiveJournal⟧⟫ now⟧\">⟦r¦plugin¦Install Now⟧</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=livejournal-importer&#038;from=import&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦¦More information about ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦LiveJournal⟧⟫⟧\">⟦r¦¦Details⟧</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-desc'>⟦r¦¦Import posts from LiveJournal using their API.⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr class='importer-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='import-system'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-title'>⟦r¦¦Movable Type and TypePad⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-action'><a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/update.php?action=install-plugin&#038;plugin=movabletype-importer&#038;from=import&#038;_wpnonce={{nonce:install-plugin_movabletype-importer}}\" class=\"install-now\" data-slug=\"movabletype-importer\" data-name=\"⟦a¦¦Movable Type and TypePad⟧\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦plugin¦Install ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦Movable Type and TypePad⟧⟫ now⟧\">⟦r¦plugin¦Install Now⟧</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=movabletype-importer&#038;from=import&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦¦More information about ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦Movable Type and TypePad⟧⟫⟧\">⟦r¦¦Details⟧</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-desc'>⟦r¦¦Import posts and comments from a Movable Type or TypePad blog.⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr class='importer-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='import-system'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-title'>⟦r¦¦RSS⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-action'><a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/update.php?action=install-plugin&#038;plugin=rss-importer&#038;from=import&#038;_wpnonce={{nonce:install-plugin_rss-importer}}\" class=\"install-now\" data-slug=\"rss-importer\" data-name=\"⟦a¦¦RSS⟧\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦plugin¦Install ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦RSS⟧⟫ now⟧\">⟦r¦plugin¦Install Now⟧</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=rss-importer&#038;from=import&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦¦More information about ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦RSS⟧⟫⟧\">⟦r¦¦Details⟧</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-desc'>⟦r¦¦Import posts from an RSS feed.⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr class='importer-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='import-system'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-title'>⟦r¦¦Tumblr⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-action'><a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/update.php?action=install-plugin&#038;plugin=tumblr-importer&#038;from=import&#038;_wpnonce={{nonce:install-plugin_tumblr-importer}}\" class=\"install-now\" data-slug=\"tumblr-importer\" data-name=\"⟦a¦¦Tumblr⟧\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦plugin¦Install ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦Tumblr⟧⟫ now⟧\">⟦r¦plugin¦Install Now⟧</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=tumblr-importer&#038;from=import&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦¦More information about ⟪%s¦⟦a¦¦Tumblr⟧⟫⟧\">⟦r¦¦Details⟧</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-desc'>⟦r¦¦Import posts &amp; media from Tumblr using their API.⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr class='importer-item'>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='import-system'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-title'>WordPress</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-action'><a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/update.php?action=install-plugin&#038;plugin=wordpress-importer&#038;from=import&#038;_wpnonce={{nonce:install-plugin_wordpress-importer}}\" class=\"install-now\" data-slug=\"wordpress-importer\" data-name=\"WordPress\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦plugin¦Install ⟪%s¦WordPress⟫ now⟧\">⟦r¦plugin¦Install Now⟧</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=wordpress-importer&#038;from=import&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"⟦a¦¦More information about ⟪%s¦WordPress⟫⟧\">⟦r¦¦Details⟧</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td class='desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='importer-desc'>⟦r¦¦Import posts, pages, comments, custom fields, categories, and tags from a WordPress export file.⟧</span>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr></table>\n\t<p>⟦r¦¦If the importer you need is not listed, <a href=\"⟪%s¦{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=search&#038;type=tag&#038;s=importer⟫\">search the plugin directory</a> to see if an importer is available.⟧</p>\n</div>\n\n\t<script id=\"tmpl-wp-updates-admin-notice\" type=\"text/html\">\n\t\t<div <# if ( data.id ) { #>id=\"{{ data.id }}\"<# } #> class=\"notice {{ data.className }}\"><p>{{{ data.message }}}</p></div>\n\t</script>\n\t<script id=\"tmpl-wp-bulk-updates-admin-notice\" type=\"text/html\">\n\t\t<div id=\"{{ data.id }}\" class=\"{{ data.className }} notice <# if ( data.errorMessage ) { #>notice-error<# } else { #>notice-success<# } #>\">\n\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.successMessage ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t{{{ data.successMessage }}}\n\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.errorMessage ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"button-link bulk-action-errors-collapsed\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{{{ data.errorMessage }}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦Show more details⟧\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"toggle-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t<# if ( data.errorMessages ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bulk-action-errors hidden\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<# _.each( data.errorMessages, function( errorMessage ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>{{ errorMessage }}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<# } ); #>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</script>\n\t\n"
}